canon-prelude.ndjson#L3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
<c.YHWH.YAHWEH.ADONAI><c.paragraph><ruby>I<00:00:02.090>n<00:00:02.181> <00:00:02.272>t<00:00:02.363>h<00:00:02.454>e<00:00:02.545> <00:00:02.636>b<00:00:02.727>e<00:00:02.818>g<00:00:02.909>i<rt>𐄐𐄌𐄀<00:00:02.090>𐄒𐄎𐄀<00:00:02.181>𐄙𐄐𐄏𐄀<00:00:02.272>𐄕 ⠞<00:00:02.090>⠡<00:00:02.181>⡲<00:00:02.272>⠰<00:00:02.363>⡈<00:00:02.454>⠪<00:00:02.545>⡦<00:00:02.636>⡂<00:00:02.727>⠢<00:00:02.818>⠨<00:00:02.909>⠭</rt></ruby>nning, we worshiped ideals, and they shaped our character. Truth was not owned, it was pursued. Goodness was not calculated, it was practiced.</c></c>

canon-prelude.ndjson#L4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<c.ADONAI.YHWH.YAHWEH><c.contrast><ruby>B<00:00:03.090>u<00:00:03.181>t<00:00:03.272> <00:00:03.363>t<00:00:03.454>h<00:00:03.545>e<00:00:03.636>n<00:00:03.727> <00:00:03.818>w<00:00:03.909>e<rt>𐄉𐄂<00:00:03.090>𐄓𐄏𐄂<00:00:03.181>𐄔𐄏𐄂<00:00:03.272>𐄙𐄐𐄂<00:00:03.363>𐄔𐄉𐄂<00:00:03.454>𐄒𐄉 ⠅<00:00:03.090>⠺<00:00:03.181>⠰<00:00:03.272>⠀<00:00:03.363>⠻<00:00:03.454>⠮<00:00:03.545>⡅<00:00:03.636>⠹<00:00:03.727>⡯<00:00:03.818>⠥<00:00:03.909>⠡</rt></ruby> grew impatient with limits. We desired freedom without obligation. We wanted expression without consequence. And so we turned from the Word, because the Word required coherence.</c></c>

canon-prelude.ndjson#L5
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<c.YAHWEH.ADONAI.YHWH><c.insight><ruby>A<00:00:04.090>n<00:00:04.181>d<00:00:04.272> <00:00:04.363>w<00:00:04.454>e<00:00:04.545> <00:00:04.636>d<00:00:04.727>i<00:00:04.818>s<00:00:04.909>c<rt>𐄑𐄊𐄁<00:00:04.090>𐄓𐄍𐄁<00:00:04.181>𐄓𐄊𐄁<00:00:04.272>𐄙𐄐𐄏𐄁<00:00:04.363>𐄔𐄁<00:00:04.454>𐄓𐄋 ⠆<00:00:04.090>⠡<00:00:04.181>⠠<00:00:04.272>⠀<00:00:04.363>⠸<00:00:04.454>⠣<00:00:04.545>⠀<00:00:04.636>⠳<00:00:04.727>⠦<00:00:04.818>⠡<00:00:04.909>⠧</rt></ruby>overed Number. Number had no edge. No final meaning. No obligation to truth. Number could grow forever. Number could shrink without loss.</c></c>

canon-prelude.ndjson#L6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<c.YHWH.YAHWEH.ADONAI><c.warning><ruby>F<00:00:05.090>o<00:00:05.181>r<00:00:05.272> <00:00:05.363>i<00:00:05.454>d<00:00:05.545>e<00:00:05.636>a<00:00:05.727>l<00:00:05.818>s<00:00:05.909> <rt>𐄒𐄇𐄀<00:00:05.090>𐄒𐄏𐄀<00:00:05.181>𐄒𐄍𐄀<00:00:05.272>𐄙𐄊 ⠁<00:00:05.090>⠠<00:00:05.181>⠶<00:00:05.272>⠀<00:00:05.363>⠦<00:00:05.454>⠢<00:00:05.545>⡅<00:00:05.636>⠶<00:00:05.727>⠣<00:00:05.818>⠡<00:00:05.909>⡤</rt></ruby>form souls, but idols form systems. An ideal calls you upward. An idol pulls everything flat.</c></c>

