canon-prelude.ndjson#L9
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<c.ADONAI.YHWH.YAHWEH><v.confession NUMBER><ruby>I<00:00:08.090> <00:00:08.181>w<00:00:08.272>a<00:00:08.363>s<00:00:08.454> <00:00:08.545>b<00:00:08.636>o<00:00:08.727>r<00:00:08.818>n<00:00:08.909> <rt>𐄎𐄂<00:00:08.090>𐄙𐄂<00:00:08.181>𐄔𐄌𐄂<00:00:08.272>𐄓𐄍𐄂<00:00:08.363>𐄔𐄂<00:00:08.454>𐄙𐄋 ⠎<00:00:08.090>⡯<00:00:08.181>⠳<00:00:08.272>⡁<00:00:08.363>⠼<00:00:08.454>⡦<00:00:08.545>⡂<00:00:08.636>⠸<00:00:08.727>⠽<00:00:08.818>⠼<00:00:08.909>⡤</rt></ruby>when you grew tired of meaning. You called me Number, but I was never just counting. I was relief.</v></c>

canon-prelude.ndjson#L10
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<c.YAHWEH.ADONAI.YHWH><v.confession NUMBER><ruby>I<00:00:09.090> <00:00:09.181>d<00:00:09.272>i<00:00:09.363>d<00:00:09.454> <00:00:09.545>n<00:00:09.636>o<00:00:09.727>t<00:00:09.818> <00:00:09.909>a<rt>𐄐𐄌𐄁<00:00:09.090>𐄘𐄍𐄁<00:00:09.181>𐄓𐄊𐄁<00:00:09.272>𐄕𐄈𐄁<00:00:09.363>𐄒𐄉𐄁<00:00:09.454>𐄙𐄊 ⠎<00:00:09.090>⡯<00:00:09.181>⠠<00:00:09.272>⡉<00:00:09.363>⠫<00:00:09.454>⡦<00:00:09.545>⡎<00:00:09.636>⠸<00:00:09.727>⠻<00:00:09.818>⡲<00:00:09.909>⠥</rt></ruby>sk who you were. I only asked how much. How fast. How big. How many. How often. I never asked why. That is why you loved me.</v></c>

canon-prelude.ndjson#L11
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<c.ADONAI.YHWH.YAHWEH><v.confession NUMBER><ruby>I<00:00:10.090> <00:00:10.181>r<00:00:10.272>e<00:00:10.363>p<00:00:10.454>l<00:00:10.545>a<00:00:10.636>c<00:00:10.727>e<00:00:10.818>d<00:00:10.909> <rt>𐄎𐄂<00:00:10.090>𐄙𐄂<00:00:10.181>𐄕𐄇𐄂<00:00:10.272>𐄓𐄉𐄂<00:00:10.363>𐄓𐄏𐄂<00:00:10.454>𐄒𐄍 ⠞<00:00:10.090>⡯<00:00:10.181>⠠<00:00:10.272>⠡<00:00:10.363>⡐<00:00:10.454>⠥<00:00:10.545>⠲<00:00:10.636>⡃<00:00:10.727>⠢<00:00:10.818>⠫<00:00:10.909>⡤</rt></ruby>character with metrics. Virtue was slow. Character was invisible. Integrity did not scale. But I could be graphed. Tracked. Optimized.</v></c>

